<title>SWITZERLAND: CSFB cuts Stratec EPS outlook, repeats buy.</title>
<headline>CSFB cuts Stratec EPS outlook, repeats buy.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSFB said it had reduced its earnings per share estimate for medical technology group Stratec, but reiterated its buy recommendation for shares.</p>
<p>It kept its 12-month price target at 2,400 Swiss francs.</p>
<p>It gave these earnings estimates after Stratec reported 22.7 percent sales growth in the first half but said operating margings would slip in the second half.</p>
<p>Net profit (million Sfr)  EPS (new)  EPS (old) Dividend (Sfr)</p>
<p> 1997	 45.7		 80.6	   85.1	 25</p>
<p> 1998	 58.7		103.5	  105.6	 NA</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
